WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.467 --> 00:00:02.933
This is Flint. You learn a job by doing it.

2
00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:06.833
Pick a role that's hiring in Alberta, like energy analyst.

3
00:00:07.567 --> 00:00:10.867
Your manager hands you a real brief, built on real data.

4
00:00:11.533 --> 00:00:13.200
Your coach helps when you get stuck.

5
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.967
Submit the work, and get scored on four skills.

6
00:00:17.833 --> 00:00:19.933
Every project goes into your portfolio.

7
00:00:20.733 --> 00:00:23.533
So by your first interview, you've already done the job.
